e president's  doing and what his condition is and to  make sure that he's  healthy and able to govern the country  and it's not  just president trump who has gotten this  diagnosis and several others in his  administration and just in his circle  more broadly  uh and it seems like we're getting a new  diagnosis every half hour here from  another individual uh but can you talk  me through  just some of the folks even from this  morning who have gotten a copy 19  diagnosis  yeah one that just came out right before  this press conference is new jersey  governor chris christie  he was obviously you wouldn't think that  this is this is a huge deal but  he was at the white house on saturday  for that confirmation or the nomination  event for amy coney barrett the  president supreme court nominee  so he was outside around 150 guests or  so  high-level white house officials uh  members of congress  conservative activists the president the  supreme court nominee and her family  he was also at the white house on sunday  for a news conference that the president  held  with reporters i was in the room for  that one he was sitting next to rudy  giuliani  that those two men were involved in  debate prep for the president behind  closed doors on sunday  then he was back at the white house on  monday so he had exposure to a lot of  people  high level people at the white house  including the president  and you know we're just again learning  that you know senator ron johnson tested  positive  this is someone who's you know key  republican senator i mean the list goes  on and on  i did learn uh today that rudy giuliani  the one who i just mentioned  uh actually tested negative yesterday so  um he's in the clear  as of right now but uh we're still have  a huge list of officials to go through  and of course  they'll be coming and getting tested in  the coming days to see if this is uh  something that is incubating and they  might test positive in the future  and you mentioned jordan u